    <p class="cc-report-table-note" id="benchmark-note">Bookings per 100 attempts = bookings ÷ attempts × 100. Attempts per booking = attempts ÷ bookings, rounded to a whole number. Fleet totals include failed and cancelled attempts. Abstrakt counts qualified appointments booked.</p>
    <div class="lp-field-note" id="connection-benchmarks">
      <h3>What Gong and Cognism measure</h3>
      <p><a href="https://www.gong.io/blog/the-hidden-power-of-cold-calling-insights-from-300m-calls">Gong analysed more than 300 million calls</a>. Average reps connected on 5.4% of dials and turned 4.6% of conversations into bookings. Top-quartile reps connected on 13.3% of dials and booked meetings from 16.7% of conversations. At 800 dials, Gong’s example works out to 2 bookings for average reps and 18 for the top quartile.</p>
      <p>WHAM’s 2025 dataset includes 41,936 connected calls and 27,513 conversations. <a href="https://www.cognism.com/reports/state-of-outbound-2026">Cognism’s 2026 outbound study</a> shows a 13.3% cold-call answer rate for its SDRs using verified contact data.</p>
    </div>
